// The seam that lets Stillhouse not become an accounting package.
//
// Stillhouse knows what happened and what it was worth. It does not know
// which account each belongs in — that is the licensee's chart of
// accounts — so the mapping is data the operator supplies, and an event
// with no mapping is reported as unmapped rather than posted somewhere
// invented. A journal line in the wrong account is worse than a missing
// one: it reconciles, and nobody looks again.

